message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "fraud-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a standardized training and evaluation protocol for
  sequential fraud detection: downloads public fraud and AML transaction datasets,
  normalizes them to a shared schema, assigns deterministic temporal splits, and adds
  synthetic label delay.
